description=Replaces Project Zomboid's list inventory with a grid of square tiles (Build 42). Identical items auto-stack with a counter; left-click a stack to inspect each item. Every container within reach stacks as a section with its own verbs - sort, transfer, and the object's own controls. Your gear gets a docked window with a live 3D character. Settings panel in game, full controller support, full multiplayer support.
